# vmm: one virtual machine's monitor (VMM-001). It holds the VM creation
# authority only when its startup entry approves it, (vm-create
# approve-declared); its window and its guest.console outlet show the
# guest's serial console. No files, no network: the guest image is built in.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.vmm"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    (service "logstore" "logstore")
    (service "desktop" "desktop")
    (Request.Kernel_Object (Kernel_Object_Request Kernel_Object.VM_Create "vm-create"))]
  outlets => [(Outlet "guest.console" Element.Text pages => 4)])
